   "self_ref": "#/texts/2",
   "text": "Left second. Cooling was applied at a fixed rate of 2 C per minute until the target of 25 C was reached. The holding time was 10 min for all conditions."
  },
  {
   "children": [],
   "content_layer": "body",
   "label": "text",
   "orig": "Right first. Two independent operators repeated the protocol on separate days. Agreement between operators was 98.2 percent, and no systematic offset was detected in the paired comparison.",
